      "text": "From June 24 through August 23, major Main Building improvements leave one elevator operating at a time, suspend in-person visitor and Innovation Hub desks, shift visitor services to the campus portal, close first- to third-floor restrooms, and occasionally interrupt cooling for five to ten minutes. Students, staff, and members should use Central Library restrooms; visitors should generally use facilities outside the building, with the West Complex exhibition hall nearest, while accessible-restroom users go to the Student Centre. Contract staff must use the designated service entrance, and guidance is limited to disclosed impacts, not nonpublic work."
